# Veyron design system

New and edited UI uses `src/constants/designSystem.ts`. Do not invent colors, radii, type sizes, or spacing.

- The platform name is Veyron. Do not label the product OmniFlow.
- Color comes from `useFitnessPalette()` or `useTheme().colors`. Those palettes are the Veyron tokens. Brand accent is `palette.lime` (cobalt), text on it is `palette.onLime`.
- Radius: `radius.xs` 6, `sm` 8, `md` 12, `lg` 16 cards, `xl` 20 heroes, `full` pills and the FAB.
- Space: 16px gutter, 12–16px stack gap, 64px header, 76px dock, 56px FAB, 96px scroll clearance above the dock.
- Type: `typeScale.hero | section | subhead | body | caption` from Plus Jakarta Sans. Metrics use `typeScale.hero`.
- Cards: white surface, 1px `palette.border`, `radius.lg`, 16px padding, `elevation.card`.
- Do not add Tailwind, CSS variables, or one-off hex values in components.
